# Frontend

Stack: **React 19**, **Vite 6**, **TypeScript strict**, **React Router 7**, **MUI 6** + **Tailwind v4** (`@tailwindcss/vite`), **Lucide** icons. **No TanStack Query. No Zod. No `features/` folders.**

## Entry and providers

`main.tsx` → `App` only. Provider order (outside → in), matching `frontend/src/App.tsx`:

```tsx
<ThemeProvider theme={appTheme}>
  <CssBaseline />
  <AuthProvider>
    <CatalogProvider>
      <CartProvider>
        <BrowserRouter>
          <ScrollToTop />
          <ErrorBoundary title="Algo salió mal">
            <Routes>...</Routes>
          </ErrorBoundary>
          <ShopBottomNav />
        </BrowserRouter>
      </CartProvider>
    </CatalogProvider>
  </AuthProvider>
</ThemeProvider>
```

`CartProvider` and `CatalogProvider` wrap the whole app (POS included), not only `ShopLayout`.

## Folder structure

```
frontend/src/
├── App.tsx
├── pages/            # Home, Catalogo, Checkout*, Login, POS, Pedidos, EditarPagina, NotFound
├── components/       # layout, shop, POS
├── context/          # Auth, Cart, Catalog, Pos
├── lib/              # apiUrl, apiClient, *Api.ts, supabase (auth only), muiTheme
└── assets/           # brand, hero video, decorative PNGs — catalog product photos from API
```

Product catalog images come from API (`imageUrl` / `/api/catalog/files/...`), not as product-id PNG imports.

## Routing

- Nested layouts with `Outlet` (`ShopLayout` for public shop).
- Protected routes: `RequirePosAccess` / `RequireAdminAccess` + `?next=` redirect to login.
- `lazy()` + `Suspense` for `/pos`, `/pedidos`, `/pos/pedidos-entregados`.
- Global `ErrorBoundary` around `Routes`; extra boundary inside each high-risk guarded route.
- `Route path="*"` → `NotFound` (under shop layout).

## Auth (client)

- `lib/supabase.ts`: anon client singleton; `isSupabaseConfigured` guard; `clearPersistedAuthSession()`.
- **Role, `canAccessPos`, `isAdmin` from `GET /api/me` only** — not `supabase.from('profiles')`.
- `ready` flag before guards; `onAuthStateChange` only (no parallel `getSession()` init). Detail: `auth-session-method.mdc`.
- Pass token via `session.access_token` / `withAccessToken()` — never read the JWT from `localStorage` by hand.

## API client

- `lib/apiUrl.ts`: `apiUrl()`, `backendHint()` — env **`VITE_BACKEND_URL`**.
- `lib/apiClient.ts`: `ApiHttpError`, `apiFetch`, `handleApiJsonError`, `fetchJson`.
- Domain modules (`posApi.ts`, `catalogApi.ts`, `shopApi.ts`) wrap `apiFetch` / `fetchJson`.
- POS 401: `withAccessToken` / `PosContext` refresh session once and retry once.

Dev: empty `VITE_BACKEND_URL` → Vite proxy `/api` → `http://127.0.0.1:8000`. Prod: `VITE_BACKEND_URL` required at build.

## Data fetching

No query library. Catalog loads in `CatalogContext`. POS sales/history via `posApi` from POS pages/context. Shop checkout via `shopApi`.

## Styling

- Tokens in `index.css` (`:root` + `@theme`); MUI theme `appTheme` in `lib/muiTheme.ts`.
- Layout/spacing: Tailwind. Complex widgets: MUI.
- Fonts via `index.html` Google Fonts link — not `@import` in CSS.

## Forms

- MUI `TextField` + HTML / Pydantic validation. No Formik, react-hook-form, or Zod.

## Performance

- Lazy routes for POS / pedidos.
- Hero `<video>`: `autoPlay muted loop playsInline`. Honor `prefers-reduced-motion` on the catalog CTA animation.
- No `manualChunks` in `vite.config.ts`.

## PWA / icons

`public/`: favicon set, `apple-touch-icon.png` (180×180), `icon-192.png`, `icon-512.png`, `icon-512-maskable.png`, `site.webmanifest`. See `web-app-icons.mdc`.

## Tooling

- `vite.config.ts`: `strictPort: true`, proxy `/api`, `appType: "spa"`.
- Build: `tsc -b && vite build`.
- Scripts: `"lint": "eslint ."`, `"test": "vitest run"`. Root Husky calls `npm run eslint` which runs `npm run lint --prefix frontend`.
- Declare `VITE_*` in `vite-env.d.ts`.

## Anti-patterns

- ❌ `REACT_APP_*`, `setupProxy.js`, `VITE_API_URL` (this repo uses `VITE_BACKEND_URL`)
- ❌ `fetch` to Supabase PostgREST for business data
- ❌ `process.env` — use `import.meta.env.VITE_*`
- ❌ Export utilities from `*.tsx` (except `src/context/**`) — use `lib/`
- ❌ Provider inside router if guards need auth context
- ❌ Adding TanStack Query / Zod / `features/` without an explicit request
